## Recursion

### Factorial

Multiply all the numbers from 1 up to and including the given number

```elixir
defmodule Factorial do
  # base case
  def of(1), do: 1

  def of(n) do
    n * of(n - 1)
  end

  # tail recursion version
  def of_tail_rec(n, acc \\ 1) # 1 is default value
  def of_tail_rec(1, acc), do: acc
  def of_tail_rec(n, acc), do: of_tail_rec(n - 1, acc * n)
  
end

Factorial.of(5)
```

```elixir
Factorial.of_tail_rec 5
```

using `num` as a variable through an error because a function was expected

